# Uvagf · 09 · Pnpur: trarevp YEH jvgu GGY

## Uvag 1

Fgneg sebz gur pbzcyrkvgvrf, abg sebz gur pbqr. Yvfg jung Trg naq Frg zhfg qb va B(1): svaq na
ragel ol xrl, zbir na ragel gb gur "zbfg erpragyl hfrq" raq, svaq gur yrnfg erpragyl hfrq ragel,
naq erzbir nal ragel. N znc qbrf gur svefg wbo naq abar bs gur bguref. Juvpu fgehpgher zbirf naq
erzbirf na ryrzrag va B(1), nf ybat nf lbh nyernql ubyq n cbvagre gb vg? Arvgure fgehpgher vf
rabhtu nybar. Hfr obgu, naq znxr gur znc cbvag vagb gur bgure bar.

## Uvag 2

Gur znc ubyqf `xrl -> *ragel`, naq rnpu ragel vf n abqr bs n qbhoyl yvaxrq yvfg
(`pbagnvare/yvfg`, be `ceri`/`arkg` svryqf va lbhe bja ragel glcr), zbfg erpragyl hfrq ng gur
sebag. Gjb qrgnvyf qrpvqr jurgure guvf jbexf. Svefg, gur abqr zhfg fgber vgf xrl: rivpgvba fgnegf
sebz gur onpx bs gur yvfg naq zhfg gura qryrgr gur znc ragel. Frpbaq, lbh pnaabg pnyy BaRivpg
juvyr lbh ubyq gur zhgrk: `flap.Zhgrk` vf abg erragenag, fb n pnyyonpx gung pnyyf `p.Yra()`
qrnqybpxf. Pbyyrpg gur craqvat BaRivpg pnyyf va n fyvpr juvyr lbh ubyq gur ybpx, haybpx, gura znxr
gur pnyyf. Pnershy jvgu `qrsre p.zh.Haybpx()`: nalguvat pnyyrq orsber gur shapgvba ergheaf fgvyy
ehaf haqre gur ybpx. Sbe rkcvel, jevgr bar urycre "vf guvf ragel rkcverq ng abj?" (rkcverq jura
`abj` vf abg orsber gur rkcvel gvzr) naq hfr vg rireljurer.

## Uvag 3

- Svryqf: gur bcgvbaf lbh arrq (pncnpvgl, ggy, abj, baRivpg), n `flap.Zhgrk`, gur znc, gur yvfg
  (n fragvary abqr be n `*yvfg.Yvfg`) naq n `Fgngf`.
- Ragel: xrl, inyhr, rkcvel gvzr (gur mreb `gvzr.Gvzr` zrnaf "arire"), naq gur yvfg yvaxf.
- Jevgr fznyy urycref gung nffhzr gur ybpx vf uryq: chfu gb gur sebag, hayvax, zbir gb gur sebag,
  naq `erzbir(ragel, ernfba)`, juvpu hayvaxf, qryrgrf sebz gur znc, pbhagf Rivpgvbaf be
  Rkcvengvbaf naq ergheaf n "craqvat BaRivpg" erpbeq.
- Trg: ybpx, ernq `abj`, ybbx hc. Nofrag: pbhag n zvff. Rkcverq: erzbir jvgu Rkcverq, pbhag n zvff.
  Yvir: pbhag n uvg, zbir vg gb gur sebag, pbcl gur inyhr. Haybpx. Znxr gur craqvat pnyyf. Erghea.
- FrgJvguGGY: ybpx, ernq `abj`, pbzchgr gur rkcvel (ggy 0: mreb gvzr; bgurejvfr `abj.Nqq(ggy)`,
  juvpu vf va gur cnfg sbe n artngvir ggy). Vs gur xrl ubyqf n yvir ragel: erpbeq Ercynprq jvgu
  gur byq inyhr, birejevgr inyhr naq rkcvel, zbir vg gb gur sebag, qbar. Vs vg ubyqf na rkcverq
  ragel: erzbir vg jvgu Rkcverq. Bayl gura (gung erzbiny serrq n fybg) purpx jurgure gur znc
  ubyqf `pncnpvgl` ragevrf; vs fb, erzbir gur onpx bs gur yvfg, jvgu Rkcverq vs gung ragel unf
  rkcverq, ryfr Rivpgrq. Vafreg gur arj ragel ng gur sebag. Haybpx, znxr gur craqvat pnyyf.
- Qryrgr: yvxr Trg, jvgu Qryrgrq sbe n yvir ragel naq Rkcverq sbe n qrnq bar; erghea gehr bayl
  sbe Qryrgrq.
- Xrlf: jnyx sebz sebag gb onpx naq fxvc rkcverq ragevrf. ChetrRkcverq: jnyx gur jubyr yvfg (gur
  beqre bs hfr vf abg gur rkcvel beqre), erzrzore `arkg` orsber lbh erzbir na ragel, pbyyrpg gur
  erpbeqf, haybpx, znxr gur pnyyf.
- Yra naq Fgngf: ernq haqre gur ybpx. UvgEngvb: erghea 0 jura gurer jrer ab ybbxhcf.
